      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Sync Customer Integration Configurations",
      "Anchor": "sync-customer-integration-configurations",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "The Export Application Evaluation functionality requires additional configuration values to be created to complete customer onboarding for Recruiter System Connect (RSC). Configurations are a set of key-value pairs defined for a specific integration. For more details, refer to Module - 1.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Sync Customer Integration Configurations",
      "Anchor": "sync-customer-integration-configurations",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "Here is an example request that sets the EVAL_CALLBACK_URL key for the IN_ATS_INDICATOR integration type:",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Sync Customer Integration Configurations",
      "Anchor": "sync-customer-integration-configurations",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "Note",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Sync Customer Integration Configurations",
      "Anchor": "sync-customer-integration-configurations",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "The latest API version is 202604. Use this version in the LinkedIn-Version header for all API requests to access the most recent features and improvements.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "Sample Upsert Request",
      "Anchor": "sample-upsert-request",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Sample Upsert Request"
      ],
      "Text": "curl --location --globoff --request PUT \u0027https://api.linkedin.com/rest/integrationConfigurations?ids[0].integrationContext=urn%3Ali%3Aorganization%3A{org_id}\u0026ids[0].integrationType=IN_ATS_INDICATOR\u0026ids[0].tenantType=RECRUITER\u0026ids[0].configurationName=EVAL_CALLBACK_URL\u0027 \\\n--header \u0027x-restli-method: batch_update\u0027 \\\n--header \u0027LinkedIn-Version: 202602\u0027 \\\n--header \u0027Content-Type: application/json\u0027 \\\n--header \u0027Authorization: Bearer {token}\u0027 \\\n--data \u0027{\n    \u0022entities\u0022: {\n        \u0022integrationContext=urn%3Ali%3Aorganization%3A{org_id}\u0026integrationType=IN_ATS_INDICATOR\u0026tenantType=RECRUITER\u0026configurationName=EVAL_CALLBACK_URL\u0022: {\n            \u0022configurationValue\u0022: {\n                \u0022string\u0022: \u0022https://customer.application.evaluation.callback.com/goes/here\u0022\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\u0027",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "Sample Upsert Request",
      "Anchor": "sample-upsert-request",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Sample Upsert Request"
      ],
      "Text": "curl --location --globoff --request PUT \u0027https://api.linkedin.com/rest/integrationConfigurations?ids[0].integrationContext=urn%3Ali%3Aorganization%3A{org_id}\u0026ids[0].integrationType=IN_ATS_INDICATOR\u0026ids[0].tenantType=RECRUITER\u0026ids[0].configurationName=EVAL_CALLBACK_URL\u0027 \\\n--header \u0027x-restli-method: batch_update\u0027 \\\n--header \u0027LinkedIn-Version: 202603\u0027 \\\n--header \u0027Content-Type: application/json\u0027 \\\n--header \u0027Authorization: Bearer {token}\u0027 \\\n--data \u0027{\n    \u0022entities\u0022: {\n        \u0022integrationContext=urn%3Ali%3Aorganization%3A{org_id}\u0026integrationType=IN_ATS_INDICATOR\u0026tenantType=RECRUITER\u0026configurationName=EVAL_CALLBACK_URL\u0022: {\n            \u0022configurationValue\u0022: {\n                \u0022string\u0022: \u0022https://customer.application.evaluation.callback.com/goes/here\u0022\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\u0027",
      "Headers": [],
